	"interactive_mode.navigation_key_action_p_p_p_p":
		"\n**Navigation**\n| Key | Action |\n|-----|--------|\n| `{p0}` / `{p1}` / `{p2}` / `{p3}` | Move cursor / browse history |\n| `{p4}` / `{p5}` | Move by word |\n| `{p6}` | Start of line |\n| `{p7}` | End of line |\n| `{p8}` | Jump forward to character |\n| `{p9}` | Jump backward to character |\n| `{p10}` / `{p11}` | Scroll by page |\n\n**Editing**\n| Key | Action |\n|-----|--------|\n| `{p12}` | Send message |\n| `{p13}` | New line{p14} |\n| `{p15}` | Delete word backwards |\n| `{p16}` | Delete word forwards |\n| `{p17}` | Delete to start of line |\n| `{p18}` | Delete to end of line |\n| `{p19}` | Paste the most-recently-deleted text |\n| `{p20}` | Cycle through the deleted text after pasting |\n| `{p21}` | Undo |\n\n**Other**\n| Key | Action |\n|-----|--------|\n| `{p22}` | Path completion / accept autocomplete |\n| `{p23}` | Cancel autocomplete / abort streaming |\n| `{p24}` | Clear editor (first) / exit (second) |\n| `{p25}` | Exit (when editor is empty) |\n| `{p26}` | Suspend to background |\n| `{p27}` | Cycle thinking level |\n| `{p28}` / `{p29}` | Cycle models |\n| `{p30}` | Open model selector |\n| `{p31}` | Toggle tool output expansion |\n| `{p32}` | Toggle thinking block visibility |\n| `{p33}` | Edit message in external editor |\n| `{p34}` | Copy selection or last assistant message |\n| `{p35}` | Queue follow-up message |\n| `{p36}` | Restore queued messages |\n| `{p37}` | Paste image or text from clipboard |\n| `/` | Slash commands |\n| `!` | Run bash command |\n| `!!` | Run bash command (excluded from context) |\n",
